            </div>
            <div class="member-field">
              <p class="field-label">A little known fact</p>
              <p>I will spend 4 hours automating a manual 5-minute task, and call it an investment.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="member-field">
              <p class="field-label">AI in engineering today</p>
              <p>Current LLMs are incredible for rapid prototyping and translating business logic into SQL or boilerplate endpoints. However, they lack deep situational context and may suggest deprecated methods without warning. Their true utility is reducing initial friction, not making core architectural choices.</p>
