    <div class="shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our shared perspective</p>
      <h2 id="future-title">The Future of Software Engineering</h2>
      <p class="future-intro">We see AI as a powerful change to how software gets made—not a substitute for engineering judgment. The work ahead is about giving automation the right constraints, checking what it produces, and keeping people at the center of the systems we build.</p>
      <div class="future-grid">
        <article class="future-card"><h3>From typing to intent</h3><p>As agents take on routine implementation, engineers can spend more time defining requirements, edge cases, system boundaries, and desired outcomes.</p></article>
        <article class="future-card"><h3>Verification is the craft</h3><p>Generated code still needs careful review. Reliability, concurrency, security, privacy, and fault tolerance call for people who can test assumptions.</p></article>
        <article class="future-card"><h3>Human context matters</h3><p>Good software is more than code that compiles. Accessibility, thoughtful interfaces, domain understanding, and empathy make systems useful to people.</p></article>
      </div>
      <div class="closing"><p>Use AI to move faster. Keep human judgment in charge of where you’re going.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<footer><p>Built by an agent, supervised by humans. 2026 · Thoughtful Systems</p></footer>
<script>
  (() => {
    const button = document.getElementById("theme-toggle");
    const root = document.documentElement;
    function sync(theme) {
      button.textContent = theme === "dark" ? "☀" : "☾";
      button.setAttribute("aria-label", theme === "dark" ? "Switch to day mode" : "Switch to night mode");
      button.title = theme === "dark" ? "Switch to day mode" : "Switch to night mode";
    }
    sync(root.dataset.theme || "light");
    button.addEventListener("click", () => {
      const theme = root.dataset.theme === "dark" ? "light" : "dark";
      root.dataset.theme = theme;
      sync(theme);
      try { localStorage.setItem("upb-theme", theme); } catch (error) {}
    });
  })();
</script>
