          <div class="field"><p class="label">AI in software engineering today</p><p>AI is an unbelievable interactive tutor that demystifies obscure compiler errors in seconds. Relying on it too early creates an illusion of competence: you may understand the output without understanding the mechanics beneath it.</p></div>
