          <div class="field"><p class="label">AI in software engineering today</p><p>AI is unmatched for boilerplate and syntax lookups, but frequently hallucinates subtle logical flaws that make debugging twice as tedious. It speeds up typing without genuinely understanding architecture or context. It works best as an eager junior developer whose every commit needs thorough code review.</p></div>
