          <div class="field"><p class="label">AI in software engineering today</p><p>AI assistants multiply productivity for well-understood domains and boilerplate, but struggle with complex legacy codebases. They can be confidently wrong about synchronization and concurrency. AI is a fast copilot, but you cannot let it navigate without senior oversight.</p></div>
