      <article class="person">
        <div class="person-head"><img class="portrait" src="{{image:Rafee.png}}" alt="Rafee"><div><h3 class="person-name">Rafee</h3><p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science · 1st semester</p></div></div>
        <div class="details">
          <div class="field"><p class="label">Interests</p><ul class="interests"><li>Frontend UI/UX</li><li>React / Next.js</li><li>Table tennis</li><li>Photography</li></ul></div>
          <div class="field"><p class="label">Fun fact</p><p>I judge coffee shops entirely by their Wi-Fi stability and latency to GitHub.</p></div>
          <div class="field"><p class="label">AI in software engineering today</p><p>AI is an unbelievable interactive tutor that demystifies obscure compiler errors in seconds. Relying on it too early creates an illusion of competence: you may understand the output without understanding the mechanics beneath it.</p></div>
